{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 18, "model_name": "mistralai/mistral-small-4-119b-2603", "content": "In sooth and with great mirth do I present unto thee a journey most wondrous and fair to the land of Nippon where the sun doth rise anew. Pray mark well this itinerary writ in the tongue of mine own dear bard.\n\n**Act I: The Land of the Rising Sun**\n\n**Scene I: The Imperial City of Tokyo**\n\nUpon the morrow thou shalt alight in the bustling port of Tokyo. First let thy feet be guided to the sacred grounds of the Meiji Shrine where the spirits of the past do dwell. Then hie thee to the bustling thoroughfares of Shibuya where thou shalt marvel at the thronging crowds and the towering edifice known as the Shibuya Scramble Crossing.\n\nA day’s respite shalt thou take at the Ueno Park where the cherry blossoms do bloom in season. Then to the east let thy steps be led to the Akihabara where the bright lights of electronics and anime do gleam.\n\n**Scene II: The Ancient Capital of Kyoto**\n\nUpon the morrow thou shalt depart for Kyoto the ancient seat of emperors and shoguns. First let thy heart be lifted at the sight of the Kinkaku-ji the Golden Pavilion gleaming in the sun. Then to the Fushimi Inari Shrine where the torii gates do march up the mountain in a vermilion path most wondrous.\n\nA day’s rest shalt thou find in the Arashiyama Bamboo Grove where the whispers of the wind through the stalks do sing thee a lullaby. Then to the Kiyomizu-dera where the city of Kyoto doth spread before thee like a tapestry most fair.\n\n**Scene III: The Floating World of Osaka**\n\nFrom Kyoto thou shalt journey to the merchant’s paradise of Osaka. First let thy palate be delighted with the street food of Dotonbori where the takoyaki and okonomiyaki do sizzle and dance. Then to the Osaka Castle where the tales of samurai do echo through the halls.\n\nA day’s leisure shalt thou take in the Universal Studios Japan or in the aquarium where the denizens of the deep do glide and play.\n\n**Act II: The Enchanting Isle of Hokkaido**\n\n**Scene I: The Northern Wilderness**\n\nUpon the next morn thou shalt take flight to the snowy realm of Hokkaido. First let thy eyes feast upon the fields of lavender in Furano where the hues of purple do paint the land. Then to the hot springs of Noboribetsu where the waters do soothe thy weary bones.\n\nA day’s adventure shalt thou find in the Daisetsuzan National Park where the mountains do touch the heavens and the rivers do carve their paths through the land.\n\n**Act III: The Final Farewell**\n\n**Scene I: The Return to Tokyo**\n\nUpon thy return to Tokyo let thy final days be spent in the pursuit of beauty and repose. Visit the teamLab Planets where the digital art doth flow and shift like the tides. Then to the Imperial Palace where the gardens do whisper of ancient times.\n\nIn the eve of thy departure thou shalt dine at a ryokan where the kaiseki feast doth present unto thee the bounty of the land. Then with a heart full of memories thou shalt take thy leave of this fair land.\n\n**Epilogue**\n\nThus endeth thy journey through the land of Nippon. May the memories thereof ever linger in thy mind and may the gods of travel ever smile upon thy path. Fare thee well and may thy adventures be many.", "logprobs": [{"token": "In", "logprob": -1.5750490427017212}, {"token": " so", "logprob": -0.18064400553703308}, {"token": "oth", "logprob": -4.768370445162873e-07}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -1.0943577289581299}, {"token": " with", "logprob": -0.7130986452102661}, {"token": " great", "logprob": -0.1292669028043747}, {"token": " mir", "logprob": -1.0443511009216309}, {"token": "th", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": " do", "logprob": -1.2231824398040771}, {"token": " I", "logprob": -0.011299426667392254}, {"token": " present", "logprob": -0.7212188839912415}, {"token": " unto", "logprob": -0.740407407283783}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.0003507714136503637}, {"token": "e", "